EN:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Howdy, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Boy, it's good to see a familiar
face!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}That way, if I get lost in this strange
town,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} I can follow you home!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}¿Qué tal, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Cómo mola ver una cara conocida!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Así, si me pierdo en este pueblo
extraño,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡puedo seguirte a casa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Salut {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ça fait plaisir de voir enfin
un visage familier ! {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Comme ça, si jamais je ne retrouve
plus le chemin du retour,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} je pourrai
te suivre jusqu'à chez nous !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Selam, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tanıdık bir yüz görmek ne güzel!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Böylece bu garip kasabada kaybolursam{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} seni takip
edip eve dönebilirim!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I wonder what kind of fruit grows
around here.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Let's go find out,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Chissà che frutta cresce da queste
parti?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Forza, scopriamolo subito,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Komm, lass uns nachsehen,
welche Früchte hier wachsen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
